Spec: Android duplex descriptor primitives

Purpose:
  Share bounded descriptor framing and deterministic native shutdown between Agent and thin client SDK.

Owns:
  ./build.gradle
  ./src/main/AndroidManifest.xml
  ./src/main/java/dev/linkgate/descriptors/DescriptorWire.java

Must:
  Carry no network, identity or authority dependencies beyond public JSON contracts.
  Preserve output-only FIN and use kernel full shutdown to interrupt blocked IO on disposal.
  Retain descriptor ownership and close all duplicate handles exactly once.
